  <rdf:Description rdf:nodeID="commodity_iron_2_cb0">
    <crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>probably a craftsman's tool made of iron (MED s.v. iren n. 2) | some sort of implement, made of iron | probably an iron implement for coopers to drive a hoop along the staves of a barrel, but note coping iron: an instrument for the cutting of a hawk's beak or talons OED s.v. coping vbl. n.3)</crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>
